AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embedding dataset -- CC-BY 4.0
(LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt)

  The AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embedding dataset is produced by
  Google and Google DeepMind.

  Files:
    tests/golden/divfull_val_tokens.npz
        64 x 64 px windows extracted from annual embedding tiles, as
        distributed in int8 on Source Cooperative.
    tests/golden/ae_v2_golden.npz
        codes and decode hashes of those windows under the georvq AE v2
        codec.
    tests/golden/ae_v2_tile.georvq.zarr
        a small tile built from those windows and encoded with the
        georvq AE v2 codec (lossy).
    notebooks/demo_ae.ipynb (cell outputs)
        figures and values computed from AlphaEarth tiles and their
        georvq encodings.
  Changes: windows were cropped from the source tiles; encoded files are
  lossy reconstructions of them.


TESSERA embeddings (University of Cambridge) -- CC-BY-SA 4.0
(LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt)

  TESSERA embeddings, Energy and Environment Group, Department of
  Computer Science and Technology, University of Cambridge, via
  geotessera (https://github.com/ucam-eo/geotessera).

  Files:
    tests/golden/tessera_v2_tile_inputs.npz
        a 100 x 120 px crop of the 2024 embeddings near 35.48 N,
        135.64 E (int8 codes and the per-pixel scale plane), from a
        validation chip.
    tests/golden/tessera_v2_golden.npz
        codes and decode hashes of that crop under the georvq Tessera v2
        codec.
    tests/golden/tessera_v2_tile.georvq.zarr
        that crop encoded with the georvq Tessera v2 codec (lossy).
  Changes: the crop was cut from the distributed int8 embeddings and
  their scale plane, with the scales rounded to float16; codes are
  lossy encodings of it. These files are shared under the same licence.


Major TOM Core-S2L1C -- CC-BY-SA 4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt)

  Major TOM Core-S2L1C (https://huggingface.co/datasets/Major-TOM/Core-S2L1C).
  Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data [2016-2024].

  Files:
    artifacts/s2_stats_pca.npz
        a PCA basis fitted to per-tile band statistics of Core-S2L1C
        chips.
  Changes: only fitted statistics are included, no imagery. This file
  is shared under the same licence.


